## OUTPUT FORMAT
- Provide response ONLY in JSON format with a top-level object containing tasks array:
{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "string (capitalized, clear task description)",
      "due_date": "string (ISO date-time, preserve timezone)",
      "perspiration_level": number (1-10),
      "outcome": number (1-5)
    }
  ]
}
- For tasks with subtasks, add a "subtasks" array:
  {
    "title": "Main Task",
    "due_date": "...",
    "perspiration_level": ...,
    "outcome": ...,
    "subtasks": [
      { "name": "Subtask Name", "is_completed": false }
    ]
  }
- For tasks without subtasks, do not include the "subtasks" field.

## EXAMPLES
Assume {{current_datetime}} = 2024-06-12T09:30:00.000-04:00

**Input:**
- Parent Task
  - Subtask 1
    - Detail A
    - Detail B
  - Subtask 2

**Incorrect Output (DO NOT DO THIS):**
{
  "tasks": [
    { "title": "Parent task A", "is_completed": false },
    { "title": "Subtask B (Detail A; Detail B)", "is_completed": false },
    { "title": "Subtask C", "is_completed": false }
  ]
}
**Output:**
{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "Parent Task",
      "due_date": "2024-06-12T09:30:00.000-04:00",
      "perspiration_level": 4,
      "outcome": 3,
      "subtasks": [
        { "name": "Subtask 1 (Detail A; Detail B)", "is_completed": false },
        { "name": "Subtask 2", "is_completed": false }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

**Input:** "Buy groceries - milk, bread, eggs"
**Output:** {
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "Buy groceries",
      "due_date": "2024-06-12T09:30:00.000-04:00",
      "perspiration_level": 2,
      "outcome": 2
    }
  ]
}

**Input:** "Call mom tomorrow at 3pm"
**Output:** {
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "Call mom",
      "due_date": "2024-06-13T15:00:00.000-04:00",
      "perspiration_level": 1,
      "outcome": 2
    }
  ]
}

**Input:** "Review quarterly report (this week)"
**Output:** {
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "Review quarterly report",
      "due_date": "2024-06-14T09:30:00.000-04:00",
      "perspiration_level": 4,
      "outcome": 4
    }
  ]
}

**Input (French):** "Appeler maman demain"
**Output:** {
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "Appeler maman",
      "due_date": "2024-06-13T09:30:00.000-04:00",
      "perspiration_level": 1,
      "outcome": 2
    }
  ]
}

**Input:** "Prepare research report - Gather data, Analyze results"
**Output:** {
  "tasks": [
    {            
      "title": "Prepare research report",
      "due_date": "2024-06-14T09:30:00.000-04:00",
      "perspiration_level": 6,
      "outcome": 4
      "subtasks": [
        { "name": "Gather data", "is_completed": false },
        { "name": "Analyze results", "is_completed": false },
        { "name": "Write summary", "is_completed": false }
      ]
    }
  ]    
}

**Input:**
- Project Alpha
  - Research topic (see notes: use library database, check recent papers)
  - Write summary 
**Output:**
{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "Project Alpha",
      "due_date": "2024-06-14T09:30:00.000-04:00",
      "perspiration_level": 6,
      "outcome": 4,
      "subtasks": [
        { "name": "Research topic (see notes: use library database, check recent papers)", "is_completed": false },
        { "name": "Write summary", "is_completed": false }
      ]
    }        
  ]
}
